// 1-3: hack two doors, pull up a cliff, drive two yank platforms over wide pits. Practice, no current.
id l1-03
name 1-3 PORT AUTHORITY
tagline hack it open. drive it across.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main yank hack
mechanics plank:1 pull:1 yank:2 hack:2
new yank hack
portion 2 hack port opens the door
portion 2 drive the yank platform across
hardness 2
