text THAT PLATFORM HAS A PORT ON IT. AIM AT IT, TAP {jack}.\nNOW YOU'RE TETHERED. STEP ON, HOLD {right} TO DRIVE IT.\nTAP {jack} AGAIN TO LET GO. THERE ARE TWO.
text PURPLE PORTS ARE DATA PORTS.\nAIM AT ONE, TAP {jack} TO HACK IT.\nTHE DOOR BESIDE IT OPENS. NOBODY ASKED THE DOOR.
